"""
Marketplace catalogue data for the ``seed_marketplace`` management command.

Each entry is a plain dict so the data stays readable and diff-friendly:

    (title, brand, subcategory, base_price, discount_price, image, tags, specs)

``image`` names a file that already lives in ``backend/media/products/``. Images
are deliberately reused across similar products - the storefront's
``getProductImage()`` resolver in ``frontend/src/utils/productAssets.js`` keys off
the product title, so a shared backend image still renders a sensible picture.
"""

